<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University. To apply for a graduate-level program at ASU, you will first need to determine which program you are interested in, fill out the <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/dgsadmissions/Index.jsp">online application</a> and pay the nonrefundable application fee. Please send official transcripts from the university that granted your bachelor's degree to one of the following addresses:&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b>If sending by U.S. Mail:</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Arizona State University</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Graduate Admission Services</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">PO Box 871003</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Tempe AZ 85287-1003</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b>If sending by FedEx, DHL or UPS:</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Graduate Admission Services</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Arizona State University</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">1151 S. Forest Avenue, SSV 112</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Tempe AZ 85287-0112</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">If you are from a country whose native language is not English (regardless of where you may now reside), you must provide proof of English proficiency. Your application will not be reviewed without valid proof of English proficiency. For more information, please visit the <a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate/proficiency">Graduate Admission website</a>.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">The academic department may require materials to supplement the application, which may include test scores, letters of recommendation, a personal statement or resume. These supplemental requirements, along with application due dates and departmental contact info, can be found on each program's description page. For questions about specific program requirements, please refer to the program description page found in the online <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/graduate/false">academic catalog</a>.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Thank you,</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Graduate Admission Services</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">If you have additional questions related to this, please refer to this email.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div><font color="#c0c0c0">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>